  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Competence development for persons working with children with physical, mental and social handicap at institutions and in the social welfare system in Vaga and V&#xF6;ru County in Estonia. The overall aim is to create better opportunities for children living in institutions in Estonia. Total support amounts to SEK 1 012 000.</narrative>
